"The One Coloured Thing" — the OpenNote founder story (Urban Sketch · Pen & Wash style). Every drawing is made in code; no screenshots or footage.
The paid notebook app in the story is generic and unnamed. Claude is credited in words only; no Anthropic logo or interface is drawn.

Voice: Kokoro-82M (hexgrad, Apache 2.0) via kokoro-onnx, voice am_michael; the name "Archishman" voiced from explicit phonemes. Checked with faster-whisper small.en.
